orbitra-ratvar-scripture-cache = Tinker's cache
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-cache-desc = Creates a forge of advanced equipment. Choose one item every four minutes. Requires transmission coverage and a nonempty energy reserve.
orbitra-ratvar-cache-title = Tinker's cache
orbitra-ratvar-cache-ready = Ready. Choose one item.
orbitra-ratvar-cache-cooldown = Cooling down: { $seconds } seconds.
orbitra-ratvar-cache-denied = Only servants of this cult may use this equipment.
orbitra-ratvar-cache-unpowered = Requires anchoring, transmission coverage and energy.
orbitra-ratvar-cache-item-robes = Increases movement speed by 10%. Light armour with a weakness to electrical damage.
orbitra-ratvar-cache-item-cloak = Gradually obscures the wearer over three seconds, but never makes them fully invisible. Reduces movement speed by 10%.
orbitra-ratvar-cache-item-spectacles = Reveals nearby thermal silhouettes and ghosts in normal view. Slowly strains the eyes. Remove for one minute to recover. Does not grant ghost hearing or reveal hidden terrain.
